WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.225 --> 00:00:02.830
Social media, I'm very active on LinkedIn.

2
00:00:02.830 --> 00:00:04.290
Again, I know a lot of contractors

3
00:00:04.290 --> 00:00:05.630
are too.

4
00:00:05.670 --> 00:00:07.170
Some people are more comfortable with that

5
00:00:07.170 --> 00:00:09.650
than others, but ultimately,

6
00:00:09.650 --> 00:00:11.490
I'm not talking about spending half your

7
00:00:11.490 --> 00:00:13.790
day posting or becoming an influencer.

8
00:00:13.790 --> 00:00:15.170
It could be something as simple as

9
00:00:15.170 --> 00:00:17.250
sharing a picture from a job site,

10
00:00:17.430 --> 00:00:19.530
highlighting an interesting equipment application,

11
00:00:19.530 --> 00:00:22.170
or showing a successful customer delivery.

12
00:00:22.290 --> 00:00:24.230
You might be surprised how many customer

13
00:00:24.230 --> 00:00:25.490
prospects are paying attention,

14
00:00:25.790 --> 00:00:27.510
even if they're not commenting or liking

15
00:00:27.510 --> 00:00:28.430
your posts.

16
00:00:28.430 --> 00:00:30.450
It's another way you can stay visible

17
00:00:30.450 --> 00:00:32.690
and demonstrate that you know the industry

18
00:00:32.690 --> 00:00:34.970
and help create those conversations.

19
00:00:34.970 --> 00:00:37.030
The nice thing is one good post

20
00:00:37.030 --> 00:00:38.750
can reach a lot of people more

21
00:00:38.750 --> 00:00:40.400
than one sales call.
